      "params_digest": "7eaa5eff9c95fd5b",
      "query": "{\"content\": \"# Rationale (`reasoning.md`)\\n\\n**Forecast:** `probability = 0.58` (`granted = 1`, `predicted_disposition = \\\"gvr\\\"`, `confidence = 0.65`)\\n\\n## 1. Provisioned Record and Conditioning State\\n\\n- **Snapshot & Moment:** This cell forecasts `evt-order-call-for-response-disposition` (`stage: cert`, `moment: response-requested`) from the provisioned snapshot `data/cases/scotus/9026000145/record/snapshots/2026-10-06.json` (`cutoff: \\\"2026-10-06\\\"`, `mode: \\\"forward\\\"`).\\n- **Docket Postur",
